@startuml 客服聊天顺序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 80
skinparam participantBackgroundColor white
skinparam actorBackgroundColor white
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam defaultWidth 400
skinparam sequenceArrowColor Black
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantPadding 40


actor "买家" as Buyer
participant "detail.vue" as Frontend
participant "ConversationController" as ConvController
participant "MessageController" as MsgController
participant "数据库" as Database

Buyer -> Frontend++: 点击"咨询商品"
Frontend -> ConvController++: POST /api/conversations
ConvController -> Database++: 检查买家和客服是否存在
Database --> ConvController--: 返回用户信息
ConvController -> Database++: 查询是否已存在活跃会话
Database --> ConvController--: 返回查询结果
ConvController -> Database++: INSERT INTO conversations
Database --> ConvController--: 返回会话ID
ConvController --> Frontend--: 返回会话ID
Frontend --> Buyer--: 进入聊天窗口
Buyer -> Frontend++: 输入消息,点击"发送"
Frontend -> MsgController++: POST /api/conversations/:id/messages
MsgController -> Database++: 检查会话状态
Database --> MsgController--: 返回会话信息
MsgController -> Database++: 更新会话状态为活跃(如已关闭)
Database --> MsgController--: 返回更新结果
MsgController -> Database++: INSERT INTO messages
Database --> MsgController--: 返回消息ID
MsgController -> Database++: 更新会话更新时间
Database --> MsgController--: 返回更新结果
MsgController -> Database++: 查询完整消息信息
Database --> MsgController--: 返回消息详情
MsgController --> Frontend--: 返回完整消息信息
Frontend --> Buyer--: 显示消息发送成功

@enduml
